WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling memory-bridge, console, urgent.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.300 align:center
Lyra: No!

3
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.600 align:center
Kael: The swing... the sun...

4
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.900 align:center
Lyra: Mine! Not yours!

5
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Unnecessary. Release it.

6
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:11.500 align:center
Lyra: Never!

7
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:12.800 align:center
Kael: Again... the fall...

8
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.100 align:center
Lyra: Almost got it!

9
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.400 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling memory-bridge, desperate.

10
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.700 align:center
Lyra: Get back!

11
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.000 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Futility.

12
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.300 align:center
Lyra: This is mine!

13
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.600 align:center
Kael: The wall... holding...

14
00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.900 align:center
Lyra: Hold! Just a moment!

15
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:28.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Temporary. All fades.

16
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:34.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Memory-bridge, just beyond the collapse, tense.

17
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:35.800 align:center
Lyra: Gone.

18
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:37.100 align:center
Kael: Run... just run.

19
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:38.400 align:center
Lyra: Always running.

20
00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:39.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: You cannot outrun.

21
00:00:39.1000 --> 00:00:40.1000 align:center
Lyra: Watch me.

22
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:46.300 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Labyrinthine memory of the ship's engine room, dread.

23
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:47.600 align:center
Lyra: Trap.

24
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:48.900 align:center
Kael: The core... unstable.

25
00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.200 align:center
Lyra: They knew.

26
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:51.500 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We always know.

27
00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:52.800 align:center
Lyra: Which way?

28
00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:54.100 align:center
Kael: Below... the conduit...

29
00:00:55.400 --> 00:01:01.400 align:center
♪ at dawn, in A forgotten corner of the engine room, near a glowing conduit, urgent.

30
00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:02.700 align:center
Lyra: Kael! Don't fade!

31
00:01:02.1000 --> 00:01:04.1000 align:center
Kael: My mother's song... fading.

32
00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:06.300 align:center
Lyra: Hold on!

33
00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:08.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Let them go. Peace.

34
00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:10.900 align:center
Lyra: No peace! Only oblivion!

35
00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:13.200 align:center
Kael: The melody... almost gone.

36
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:18.500 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Engine room, near the conduit, desperate.

37
00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:19.800 align:center
Lyra: Stay with me.

38
00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.100 align:center
Kael: Cold... so cold...

39
00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:22.400 align:center
Lyra: Don't give up.

40
00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:24.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Pointless. They were forgotten.

41
00:01:24.1000 --> 00:01:25.1000 align:center
Lyra: Not by me!

42
00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:27.300 align:center
Kael: The warmth... gone.

43
00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:32.600 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Engine room's upper gantries, tense.

44
00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:33.900 align:center
Lyra: It knows!

45
00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:36.200 align:center
Kael: The maze... it shifts.

46
00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:37.500 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Predictable. You run.

47
00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:38.800 align:center
Lyra: I fight!

48
00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:41.100 align:center
Kael: No exit... this way.

49
00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:42.400 align:center
Lyra: Then another way!

50
00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:49.700 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in A dead-end alcove in the engine room, surrounded by dormant machinery, desperate.

51
00:01:49.1000 --> 00:01:50.1000 align:center
Lyra: Dead end.

52
00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:53.300 align:center
Kael: No escape... last time.

53
00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:55.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Surrender what is not yours.

54
00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:56.900 align:center
Lyra: Never! My memories...

55
00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.200 align:center
Kael: Mine... use mine.

56
00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:00.500 align:center
Lyra: No! I can't lose you!

57
00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:05.800 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Dead-end alcove in the engine room, desperate.

58
00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:07.100 align:center
Lyra: Forgive me.

59
00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:08.400 align:center
Kael: Remember... me.

60
00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:09.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Impossible!

61
00:02:09.1000 --> 00:02:10.1000 align:center
Lyra: Stay back!

62
00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:12.300 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: This... power...

63
00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:13.600 align:center
Lyra: It's memory!

64
00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:19.900 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Alcove, now partially open as the Loom retreats, dread.

65
00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.200 align:center
Lyra: Kael?

66
00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:22.500 align:center
Lyra: No... gone.

67
00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:23.800 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: A foolish choice.

68
00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.100 align:center
Lyra: What have I done?

69
00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:27.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: You are alone.

70
00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:31.700 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Engine room, still disoriented, horror.

71
00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.000 align:center
Lyra: My head... stop it!

72
00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:36.300 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: You seek the Anchor.

73
00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:38.600 align:center
Lyra: How do you know?

74
00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:40.900 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We absorbed him. We saw everything.

75
00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:42.200 align:center
Lyra: No!

76
00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:44.500 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your path is clear. To us.
